  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Where it runs",
      "items": [
        "Chat: in the app process, inside the HTTP request; edge passes /api/* unbuffered.",
        "Long tasks: start_job queues assistant_task; the worker runs AssistantService.run_job with the same tools (job=True, no start_job).",
        "build_assistant_service assembles the same service in both processes (job_handlers.py:173-182)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Guards on each tool call",
      "items": [
        "Workspace data-sharing level must allow the tool's level.",
        "workspaces.authorize(user, tool.action): a Viewer's chat gets read tools only.",
        "Source SQL goes through SourceQueryService (query guard, PII masking, audit); see the source-flows diagram."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Persistence",
      "items": [
        "assistant_conversations, assistant_messages, assistant_runs, assistant_run_feedback.",
        "Token usage per call: llm_usage (record_usage); budgets: llm_workspace_budgets, llm_workspace_cost_budgets.",
        "Optional light model: routing, history compaction and retitling when one is assigned."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Simplified or uncertain",
      "items": [
        "Order inside the loop is per model turn; tool calls in one turn may run in parallel (agent.py thread pool).",
        "Auto-retrieval of document passages on the first message (settings.auto_retrieve) is not drawn.",
        "The SSE frames are produced by iterating service events in api.py _frames; the timing of the save vs the done frame was not traced exactly."
      ]
    }
  ]
